                    </param>
                    <param key="speed_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>1</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="reverse_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>false</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="maintain_audio_pitch_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>false</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="loop_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>0</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="text_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>加快科技创新和产业创新融合，关键在于畅通科技成果产业化渠道。今年以来，国家加快打通科技成果落地堵点，让科技创新加速走向生产线。</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="wav_out">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>c5c8d3df744e7d84f8df78c94f81ccce.wav</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="wav_md5">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>c5c8d3df744e7d84f8df78c94f81ccce</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <custom>
                        <element>
                            <kind>audio</kind>
                            <filename>D:/TotemMeta/MetaSDK/x64/Debug/Temp/Uranus/project/c5c8d3df744e7d84f8df78c94f81ccce.wav</filename>
                        </element>
                    </custom>
                </node>
                <node version="1" id="org.uranus.block.voice_text" ptr="1872858411312">
                    <param key="enabled_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>true</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="length_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>213/5</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="media_in_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>0/1</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="speed_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>1</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="reverse_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>false</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="maintain_audio_pitch_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>false</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="loop_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>0</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="text_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>为破解科研成果和产业需求脱节的难题，今年以来，我国加速建设科技成果转化的全链条服务体系。在研发端，为提升我国制造领域关键共性技术的供给能力，国家新成立2家国家制造业创新中心，目前已累计达到32家。在中试环节，形成了由21家国家级制造业中试平台和1800多家储备平台组成的中试服务网络。在孵化阶段，全国共认定首批14家卓越级和402家标准级科技型企业孵化器，孵化企业和团队超过42.5万家。</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="wav_out">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>38f62ab340293aa5b62b53951ff9cacd.wav</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="wav_md5">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>38f62ab340293aa5b62b53951ff9cacd</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <custom>
                        <element>
                            <kind>audio</kind>
                            <filename>D:/TotemMeta/MetaSDK/x64/Debug/Temp/Uranus/project/38f62ab340293aa5b62b53951ff9cacd.wav</filename>
                        </element>
                    </custom>
                </node>
                <node version="1" id="org.uranus.block.voice_text" ptr="1871314156448">
                    <param key="enabled_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>true</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="length_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>622/25</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="media_in_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>0/1</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="speed_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
                                <track>1</track>
                            </standard>
                        </primary>
                    </param>
                    <param key="reverse_in">
                        <primary>
                            <standard>
